{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>焦點報道：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>王岸然案｜錄影會面稱被國安約談早已「賣晒報紙」　認為非立案調查故毋須保密 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4igNCKh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4igNCKh</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/47iQXST\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/47iQXST</a> </li>\n<li>六旬婦涉住所門外貼港英旗　煽動罪成判3個月住院令　官：意圖鼓勵同道中人革命 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zx8lPJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4zx8lPJ</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zzUlF3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4zzUlF3</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4z3txNq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4z3txNq</a> </li>\n<li>蔡天鳳案　蔡母張燕花、丈夫譚方駿、家翁譚澤均完成作供 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3UlIxHu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3UlIxHu</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4yOSYlW\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4yOSYlW</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4B8g7S4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4B8g7S4</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4hJgvic\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4hJgvic</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4ijpkPU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4ijpkPU</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3UutXgV\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3UutXgV</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4B9lFeM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4B9lFeM</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3VACf7n\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3VACf7n</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/47ZcIaA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/47ZcIaA</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4dFixgN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4dFixgN</a> </li>\n<li>匡智會宿舍內5度強姦院友　助理舍監判囚13年　官：行為令人極度厭惡 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3TRoTmE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3TRoTmE</a> </li>\n<li>男子葵涌廣場與警爭執案　襲警罪脫、認